feat(auth): real Supabase Auth (login, signup, password recovery)

- lib/auth.tsx: AuthContext + AuthProvider + useAuth hook
  - listens to onAuthStateChange, exposes user/session/loading
  - signIn / signUp / signOut / resetPassword / updatePassword
  - translateAuthError() maps Supabase messages to RU
  - graceful fallback when VITE_SUPABASE_* not set (mock mode)
- components/RequireAuth.tsx: route guard with loading state
- App.tsx: /app/* wrapped in <RequireAuth />, new public routes
  /signup, /forgot-password, /reset-password
- main.tsx: app wrapped in <AuthProvider>

Pages:
- Login.tsx: real signIn, error display, "Демо" button only shown
  when Supabase isn't configured
- Signup.tsx: new — email/password + full_name, success screen for
  email confirmation
- ForgotPassword.tsx: sends reset link via supabase.auth.resetPasswordForEmail
- ResetPassword.tsx: updates password, handles invalid/expired sessions

Topbar.tsx: real signOut, displays user_metadata.full_name / email,
"Аккаунт" vs "Демо-режим" label

